  "prefLabel": "Ph 2107.06 Category III: Low Risk",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2107.06 Category III: Low Risk. For the following providers without controlled substances who dispense or administer prescription medications, inspections shall be upon request of the provider’s board or provider:\n\n(a) Private practice physicians with a hospital/HMO affiliation;\n\n(b) Providers who are always affiliated with a hospital/HMO;\n\n(c) Naturopath providers with no prescription legend medications; and\n\n(d) Other health care providers with no prescription legend medications.\n\nSource. #13028, eff 4-11-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
}
